    // TODO: Implement this method to get the CPU speed
}

private int getRamSize() {
    // TODO: Implement this method to get the RAM size
}

private int getGpuPerformance() {
    // TODO: Implement this method to get the GPU performance
}
```
Note that the hardware specifications used as thresholds for low-end devices are just examples and may vary depending on the specific use case and target audience. You may need to adjust these thresholds according to your requirements. Also, the helper methods `getCpuSpeed()`, `getRamSize()`, and `getGpuPerformance()` are not implemented in this example, so you'll need to provide the implementation for these methods based on the specific Android device you're targeting.

